<title>USA: Cincinnati Milacron expands board.</title>
<headline>Cincinnati Milacron expands board.</headline>
<dateline>CINCINNATI 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cincinnati Milacron Inc said Thursday it had elected Joseph Pichler as a director, expanding the size of the board to 10 members.</p>
<p>Pichler has been chairman and chief executive officer of Kroger Co since 1990.</p>
<p>-- Chicago Newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
